WEBVTT

00:13.620 --> 00:16.950
No... A Prismer at the academy?

00:19.330 --> 00:20.960
Wow!

00:20.960 --> 00:23.660
Hey, Rani, that's a Prismer, right?

00:23.660 --> 00:25.080
Yeah, it is...

00:25.080 --> 00:29.870
It's moving! It's not like the one 
we saw in Almen that was frozen!

00:30.660 --> 00:35.720
<i>When I was but an infant, I decided 
that I'd one day defeat a Prismer on my own.</i>

00:35.720 --> 00:38.630
<i>And now here it is, right before my eyes!</i>

00:38.630 --> 00:43.190
<i>I'm so glad I was reborn to master the blade!</i>

00:43.630 --> 00:47.320
To be precise, it's not fully complete yet.

00:48.010 --> 00:49.660
It's only a matter of time.

00:51.440 --> 00:53.800
Oh, I just don't know!

00:53.800 --> 00:56.320
Which should I fight?

00:56.840 --> 01:00.440
Come on, Chris! What are you thinking?

01:00.440 --> 01:03.350
We have to get back to 
the academy, obviously!

01:03.350 --> 01:05.410
Rani! B-But...

01:05.410 --> 01:07.380
Get going.

01:07.380 --> 01:11.330
This rat over here 
was my prey from the start.

01:11.500 --> 01:14.340
<b>Hey, no fair, Ivel!</b>

01:14.340 --> 01:16.180
<b>No stealing my opponents!</b>

01:20.100 --> 01:23.960
That thing will be annihilated 
the moment it touches my shield!

02:13.110 --> 02:16.070
<b><u>Reborn</u></b>

02:13.110 --> 02:16.070
<b>to Master the Blade
\h\h\h\h\hFrom Hero-King to Extraordinary Squire\h\h\h\h\h</b>

02:13.110 --> 02:16.070
<b>to Master the Blade
From Hero-King to Extraordinary Squire</b>

03:29.060 --> 03:34.020
<b>Episode 12     Clash! Hero-King vs. King of Rainbows</b>

03:32.220 --> 03:34.730
This isn't good...

03:34.730 --> 03:37.390
What's this thing? 
Is this what they call a last boss?

03:41.690 --> 03:44.320
Leone! Liselotte!

03:44.320 --> 03:47.010
Get the people who fell 
unconscious out of here!

03:47.010 --> 03:48.580
Yes, ma'am!

03:50.870 --> 03:53.190
Buy me a little time!

03:53.800 --> 03:56.990
Yua, I'll put up a barrier.

03:56.990 --> 03:59.120
Distract the Prismer.

04:00.580 --> 04:03.270
I'm scared of the big guy, though...

04:02.510 --> 04:04.680
I will not let you talk back right now!

04:04.680 --> 04:05.780
Go do it!

04:05.780 --> 04:07.120
O-Okay!

04:16.900 --> 04:18.480
Nice work, girlie!

04:21.290 --> 04:23.150
Hey, over here!

04:26.270 --> 04:28.050
Good stuff.

04:28.050 --> 04:29.750
Nice work, old man.

04:29.750 --> 04:32.560
I'm actually still in my twenties...

04:32.830 --> 04:35.950
The only thing to do with bad stuff 
is get it over with as soon as you can.

04:37.880 --> 04:39.550
Hai-yah!

04:41.450 --> 04:43.520
Good! Nice punch!

04:43.520 --> 04:45.680
Reminds me of Inglis!

04:45.680 --> 04:48.130
No, I don't think it did anything.

04:48.400 --> 04:50.980
Huh? Looks like you pierced 
its skin, though.

04:50.980 --> 04:54.180
No, I'm being sucked in. Suck-suck.

04:54.420 --> 04:56.020
What? Seriously?

04:56.020 --> 04:56.930
Yua!

04:59.890 --> 05:02.170
I surrounded her with a barrier!

05:02.170 --> 05:04.100
Okay, wait a second.

05:04.100 --> 05:07.900
This'll hurt a little, 
but I'll blow that whole area away!

05:07.900 --> 05:09.620
ASAP, please.

05:13.150 --> 05:15.680
Heat beam incoming! Run, everyone!

05:21.670 --> 05:23.620
Brother!

05:23.620 --> 05:24.920
Leon!

05:29.810 --> 05:31.080
Brother!

05:31.080 --> 05:32.410
Are you okay?

05:33.140 --> 05:34.750
I guess...

05:34.750 --> 05:39.540
Bastard... That armor's 
been my partner for years!

05:40.430 --> 05:42.360
I'm kind of in trouble here...

05:42.940 --> 05:44.310
Yua!

05:44.310 --> 05:45.410
No...

05:45.730 --> 05:47.170
She's still okay!

05:47.170 --> 05:48.870
The barrier's working!

05:49.270 --> 05:51.510
She hasn't been completely absorbed!

05:53.060 --> 05:55.060
I'll find a way to dig her out!

05:57.020 --> 05:59.760
Silva, how's Ripple looking?

06:01.470 --> 06:03.460
She's not absorbing my power anymore.

06:03.460 --> 06:06.790
This is likely the last magicite beast.

06:06.790 --> 06:08.920
So we just have to survive this, then.

06:10.770 --> 06:13.860
Won't Ripple be waking up soon?

06:14.110 --> 06:17.550
If that happens, we can have her help...

06:17.550 --> 06:19.900
No, I wouldn't count on that.

06:20.150 --> 06:21.170
But why?

06:21.170 --> 06:24.060
This is exactly what the 
Hyral Menases are for!

06:24.060 --> 06:27.320
She'll still be weak after what happened.

06:27.320 --> 06:28.810
Don't make her exert herself.

06:29.450 --> 06:32.840
That Prismer probably isn't complete.

06:33.160 --> 06:35.750
Let's find another way!

06:37.730 --> 06:40.310
Take everyone to a pocket space 
where they'll be safe!

06:40.310 --> 06:41.750
What will you do?

06:42.200 --> 06:44.840
I'll figure things out.

06:45.270 --> 06:48.800
If I go too, the barrier will disappear!

06:48.800 --> 06:49.860
Go!

06:49.860 --> 06:51.120
Brother...

06:51.120 --> 06:52.330
Go!

06:57.770 --> 06:59.100
Here I go!

07:01.350 --> 07:04.300
You're responsible for 
your own safety, okay?

07:04.670 --> 07:07.030
Sure thing, "ma'am."

07:08.980 --> 07:10.120
Here it comes!

07:10.120 --> 07:12.080
I'll stop it!

07:13.170 --> 07:16.030
Chris, we have to get back to the academy!

07:16.340 --> 07:19.330
No, the others are there already. 
They'll be fine.

07:19.330 --> 07:21.560
It's important to believe in your comrades!

07:25.550 --> 07:28.090
Good, the town's safe.

07:28.090 --> 07:28.640
See?

07:28.640 --> 07:30.310
I don't see!

07:30.310 --> 07:33.490
You girls sure make a lot of noise.

07:33.490 --> 07:34.750
Get back to your friends.

07:35.350 --> 07:38.350
We don't have time to deal with you.

07:38.350 --> 07:41.850
W-Wait! Please don't leave!

07:41.850 --> 07:43.830
I still want to fight you...

07:42.950 --> 07:43.830
Silence!

07:43.830 --> 07:47.660
I'm not here for your entertainment, 
nor am I your playmate.

07:48.610 --> 07:50.120
We've achieved our goal

07:50.120 --> 07:53.050
of killing the Highlander emissary 
and taking his battleship.

07:53.050 --> 07:56.670
That's enough for us. We're leaving.

07:57.430 --> 08:00.130
It seems to be growing 
more complete by the second.

08:00.530 --> 08:02.750
You should hurry before it's too late.

08:03.630 --> 08:04.650
Chris!

08:06.770 --> 08:08.130
I'm disappointed.

08:08.130 --> 08:11.050
I wanted to fight you more.

08:11.310 --> 08:12.870
I'll pass.

08:12.870 --> 08:15.260
You can have that as a gift from us. Go.

08:15.520 --> 08:17.480
I'll see you again sometime.

08:17.790 --> 08:19.870
I certainly hope not.

08:32.420 --> 08:33.480
Ripple!

08:35.410 --> 08:38.340
Guys, you're safe...

08:38.340 --> 08:40.470
Not as much as you'd think.

08:41.360 --> 08:45.360
The last magicite beast 
summoned was a Prismer.

08:45.360 --> 08:48.700
What? One of my comrades became a Prismer?

08:49.090 --> 08:53.870
The principal said it wasn't 
complete yet, but...

08:53.870 --> 08:59.550
The principal and Leone's brother are 
staying outside the pocket space to stop it.

09:00.100 --> 09:01.500
Leon's here?

09:01.500 --> 09:03.510
He came to help us.

09:03.510 --> 09:05.850
Even those two aren't strong enough 
to do this on their own!

09:05.850 --> 09:08.480
Leone, can you cancel the pocket space?

09:09.940 --> 09:10.870
Okay!

09:14.360 --> 09:15.690
The school building...

09:16.860 --> 09:19.240
Miliera! Leon! Are you okay?

09:19.970 --> 09:22.620
Ripple! Good timing!

09:22.620 --> 09:24.700
You awake now, Sleeping Beauty?

09:24.960 --> 09:29.420
We're okay for now, barely, but help 
would be more than appreciated!

09:30.470 --> 09:31.570
Leave it to me.

09:34.060 --> 09:39.170
I've caused problems for everyone... 
so now I'll protect them in turn!

09:39.170 --> 09:41.420
Because I'm a Hyral Menas!

09:42.640 --> 09:44.350
Even if you were once my comrade...

09:44.350 --> 09:46.720
No, <i>because</i> you were once my comrade...

09:46.720 --> 09:48.070
I have to do this!

09:51.660 --> 09:52.770
Wow.

09:52.770 --> 09:54.820
She always did know how to move.

10:01.220 --> 10:03.220
Ripple! Get out of here!

10:06.590 --> 10:07.600
No!

10:16.280 --> 10:17.470
Ripple!

10:18.050 --> 10:20.920
No! It might hit Ripple!

10:21.400 --> 10:22.380
Damn it!

10:22.650 --> 10:24.680
What do we do, Miliera?

10:24.680 --> 10:27.350
I don't know how long that barrier will last.

10:27.640 --> 10:30.810
First, we need to get it out of the city 
before the barrier breaks

10:30.810 --> 10:32.790
and its beams can hit something!

10:34.970 --> 10:35.920
Ripple!

10:45.800 --> 10:46.970
Ripple!

10:47.550 --> 10:52.640
I'm fine. Hyral Menases are tough.

10:52.640 --> 10:57.300
If you want to get it out of the city, 
I'll be the one to draw its attention.

10:57.300 --> 11:00.620
You need to rest. I'll do that.

11:00.620 --> 11:03.500
Please... I need to be the one to...

11:04.690 --> 11:05.710
Ripple...

11:06.200 --> 11:09.400
Please, become a weapon 
and lend me your strength!

11:09.400 --> 11:10.440
I can't do that!

11:11.490 --> 11:15.000
I'm still in training, but I can do this!

11:15.000 --> 11:16.120
Please!

11:16.770 --> 11:20.900
Ever since you saved me when I was a child,

11:21.370 --> 11:24.590
I've been training so that
I could fight with you some day!

11:25.290 --> 11:28.940
I became strong, just like you told me to!

11:31.020 --> 11:32.520
Silva...

11:33.030 --> 11:36.680
I didn't think the little kid I saved 
would become such a strong young man...

11:37.450 --> 11:39.690
Time sure flies.

11:40.420 --> 11:42.650
I've gotten older, too, haven't I?

11:43.370 --> 11:46.640
You saved my life, and I want to repay you.

11:47.190 --> 11:49.240
The Highlanders are 
using you for their plots,

11:49.240 --> 11:54.930
and forcing you to fight your comrades...  
and I want to protect your heart!

11:55.990 --> 11:58.350
Silva... But...

11:59.830 --> 12:01.360
Ripple?

12:01.360 --> 12:05.000
N-No! I wasn't trying to do it!

12:05.000 --> 12:07.550
Stop it, Ripple! Don't turn into a weapon!

12:07.550 --> 12:09.330
He's still too young!

12:09.330 --> 12:12.500
N-No! I'm not the one who wants to do it...

12:12.500 --> 12:14.530
His will is drawing me in!

12:25.130 --> 12:26.530
Ripple...

12:27.680 --> 12:30.190
Th-That's Ripple...

12:30.190 --> 12:31.850
...in the form of a weapon.

12:33.020 --> 12:36.390
I can feel it... Incredible power...

12:36.740 --> 12:39.370
With this, I can defeat anything!

12:43.960 --> 12:45.990
Even a Prismer!

12:46.280 --> 12:48.190
Stop! Drop it!

12:48.190 --> 12:50.830
Silva, calm down!

12:50.830 --> 12:53.410
You can't let the power take control!

12:53.410 --> 12:55.160
You're not ready to use that!

12:55.540 --> 12:59.790
Ripple answered my request. 
Get out of the way.

13:00.140 --> 13:01.890
I said, put it down!

13:05.520 --> 13:07.170
Don't get in my way!

13:24.120 --> 13:25.660
Inglis?

13:25.660 --> 13:27.830
Looks like I made it just in time!

13:27.830 --> 13:30.240
How? In what possible way?

13:30.240 --> 13:34.860
It looks more to me like you attacked one 
of our allies before he could save the day!

13:35.160 --> 13:37.840
Please don't break my barrier!

13:38.830 --> 13:41.260
Here it comes! Miliera! Rebuild the barrier!

13:41.260 --> 13:43.040
No! There's no time!

13:43.630 --> 13:45.180
I'll take full responsibility!

13:45.630 --> 13:46.970
Inglis?!

13:52.390 --> 13:55.800
<i>I guess I can't kick it as far as Ivel...</i>

13:57.080 --> 13:59.010
It didn't work! It's going to fire!

13:59.320 --> 14:02.410
That's just what I was hoping it would do!

14:03.010 --> 14:05.100
Come on, fire!

14:07.040 --> 14:08.770
The beams are heading for the city...

14:08.770 --> 14:11.030
This is bad!

14:13.290 --> 14:15.380
The beams changed direction?

14:15.380 --> 14:18.310
Wh-What's going on?

14:18.310 --> 14:19.950
It's Inglis!

14:20.520 --> 14:22.620
She's punching the beams!

14:23.010 --> 14:25.420
All of you, disappear into the sky!

14:27.590 --> 14:30.100
It's too fast to see...

14:34.160 --> 14:38.890
<i>In the fifteen years since I was reborn... 
have I ever been this excited?</i>

14:39.440 --> 14:39.480
<b>My partner's
 a Prismer!</b>

14:39.480 --> 14:39.520
<b>My partner's
 a Prismer!</b>

14:39.520 --> 14:39.560
<b>My partner's
 a Prismer!</b>

14:39.560 --> 14:39.600
<b>My partner's
 a Prismer!</b>

14:39.600 --> 14:41.860
<b>My partner's
 a Prismer!</b>

14:39.870 --> 14:41.860
<i>I couldn't be happier!</i>

14:42.850 --> 14:46.820
Chris is definitely trying to have fun.

14:46.820 --> 14:50.710
Inglis! This isn't the time!

14:50.710 --> 14:51.860
See that light?

14:52.040 --> 14:54.670
Yua's been absorbed inside it!

14:54.670 --> 14:57.350
Yua? Got it!

15:00.270 --> 15:04.300
<i>I'll focus my attacks around Yua 
and dig her out!</i>

15:08.460 --> 15:12.500
L-Look! It's faster than when it fought me!

15:12.500 --> 15:14.170
With a body that size...

15:14.610 --> 15:16.380
I can't believe it!

15:17.200 --> 15:19.700
<i>I need to do more than
just dodge its attacks all day.</i>

15:23.070 --> 15:24.270
She blocked it?

15:24.270 --> 15:27.970
<i>It's not just fast! There's an incredible 
weight behind each of its strikes!</i>

15:27.970 --> 15:29.480
<i>Wonderful!</i>

15:33.880 --> 15:35.030
Uh, guys...

15:35.400 --> 15:39.060
She's blocking the Prismer's punches 
and kicks with her own...

15:40.450 --> 15:44.020
Maybe she was really a Hyral Menas all along?

15:44.020 --> 15:47.550
It looks like blocking is all 
she can do, though...

15:48.250 --> 15:50.790
<i>There's no opening for me 
to launch an attack of my own.</i>

15:51.440 --> 15:52.300
So...

15:54.770 --> 15:56.310
Aether Pierce!

15:58.200 --> 15:59.840
Aether Strike!

16:01.380 --> 16:05.640
Inglis! The light of Yua's barrier 
is growing weaker!

16:05.640 --> 16:09.100
It's going to completely absorb her!

16:10.050 --> 16:12.380
<i>I have one thing that might do the trick.</i>

16:12.710 --> 16:17.150
<i>I have to get close to try it...</i>

16:17.150 --> 16:19.980
<i>but it's watching for that.</i>

16:20.510 --> 16:21.540
Chris!

16:24.190 --> 16:25.420
Rani!

16:33.250 --> 16:35.370
Leone! Liselotte!

16:35.370 --> 16:37.340
We'll distract it!

16:37.340 --> 16:39.070
That'll be your chance!

16:39.930 --> 16:41.200
Here we go!

16:49.670 --> 16:52.270
Aether Strike!

16:54.230 --> 16:57.960
Even you can't dodge in mid-air!

16:57.960 --> 17:00.160
<i>That's what I've been waiting for!</i>

17:09.340 --> 17:11.240
It's working!

17:11.240 --> 17:14.520
The rainbow-colored skin 
is taking damage, too!

17:14.520 --> 17:17.680
Go! Blow it away!

17:17.680 --> 17:19.480
No!

17:19.730 --> 17:24.430
Hang in there! Stand strong! 
You can take this!

17:26.320 --> 17:27.350
Chris!

17:27.790 --> 17:28.810
Inglis!

17:30.780 --> 17:32.170
Go!

17:32.170 --> 17:35.690
Aether Breaker!

18:04.430 --> 18:05.870
Is it over?

18:06.430 --> 18:09.390
The Prismer... is defeated?

18:09.390 --> 18:11.440
Wh-Where's Inglis?

18:11.890 --> 18:13.160
She's fine!

18:19.170 --> 18:21.690
I worked up a nice sweat today!

18:22.420 --> 18:24.380
Hooray!

18:24.880 --> 18:26.610
I'm so glad!

18:26.610 --> 18:29.330
You did it, Inglis!

18:29.330 --> 18:31.230
Nice work, Inglis!

18:31.230 --> 18:32.290
You're the best!

18:32.290 --> 18:36.580
I thought for a moment that when 
it disappeared, it took Yua with it.

18:36.580 --> 18:38.600
I'm amazed you were able to save her.

18:38.600 --> 18:41.480
I pulled her out while I was 
piercing through the Prismer.

18:41.480 --> 18:45.420
That new technique is the 
strongest you've ever used!

18:45.420 --> 18:49.000
They're gonna let us eat free at the 
cafeteria for even longer now, Chris!

18:49.000 --> 18:51.120
Is that true, ma'am?

18:51.120 --> 18:54.120
Y-Yes, of course it is!

18:56.550 --> 18:58.760
I'm starving after all that fighting!

18:58.760 --> 18:59.690
So let's go!

19:00.740 --> 19:01.720
Huh?

19:01.720 --> 19:03.130
Where's the cafeteria?

19:03.130 --> 19:05.120
It got blown up.

19:05.120 --> 19:09.170
You can eat your fill when it's rebuilt.

19:12.670 --> 19:15.960
<b></b>Several Days Later

19:18.560 --> 19:19.810
Hey, you there.

19:20.090 --> 19:22.180
Stop slacking, and work.

19:22.180 --> 19:24.990
You didn't do anything 
when the big guy showed up.

19:24.990 --> 19:27.430
So you should do all the work here.

19:28.410 --> 19:32.540
I would've beaten the Prismer 
if I hadn't been interrupted!

19:33.360 --> 19:34.930
You don't believe me, do you?

19:35.470 --> 19:40.410
And what happened to the two girls who want 
the cafeteria back more than anything?

19:40.650 --> 19:43.670
They said they were going to the royal court.

19:43.670 --> 19:47.250
The king summoned them himself!

19:50.210 --> 19:53.410
Did you see what happened 
when I turned into a weapon?

19:53.410 --> 19:55.420
Yeah. That could've been a big problem.

19:55.420 --> 19:58.100
So you knew what you were doing 
when you stopped him.

19:58.710 --> 20:01.880
If Silva had fired...

20:01.880 --> 20:07.360
We would've paid a heavy price 
for defeating the Prismer.

20:08.040 --> 20:13.460
I don't know how I would've been able 
to face everyone after that.

20:13.460 --> 20:17.680
That's how the relationship between a holy 
knight and a Hyral Menas works, right?

20:19.010 --> 20:23.780
I finally understand why Eris got 
so agitated when she met Rani.

20:25.570 --> 20:28.070
Chris! I'm all ready!

20:28.580 --> 20:32.400
Don't tell Rafinha that.

20:32.400 --> 20:33.150
Of course.

20:36.340 --> 20:39.690
Thank you both so much for your help.

20:39.690 --> 20:41.090
You have my deepest gratitude.

20:41.390 --> 20:44.170
Your words honor us, sire.

20:44.400 --> 20:46.140
Especially you, Inglis.

20:46.140 --> 20:51.890
You defeated the Highlander Arch Lord alone 
and drove away the Bloodchain Brigade.

20:52.250 --> 20:55.170
The judgment and decisiveness you showed

20:55.170 --> 20:58.410
make you truly worthy 
to lead my country's knights.

20:58.410 --> 21:00.850
I'm honored... Huh?

21:00.850 --> 21:09.460
Inglis Eucus, I hereby declare you 
the new head of the Royal Guard.

21:10.530 --> 21:13.520
You're making Chris the head 
of the Royal Guard?

21:13.520 --> 21:14.530
But...

21:14.770 --> 21:19.870
Your power rivals that of a 
Hyral Menas or holy knight.

21:20.140 --> 21:22.840
None could be better suited for the job.

21:23.380 --> 21:25.850
Congratulations, Lady Inglis!

21:25.850 --> 21:27.910
Please become our leader!

21:27.910 --> 21:31.810
Sure, Chris is strong, and decisive...

21:32.260 --> 21:38.790
<i>But... this means Chris won't 
be with me anymore, right?</i>

21:38.790 --> 21:42.850
<i>I should be happy she's getting 
an offer like this, though!</i>

21:42.850 --> 21:44.890
<i>I have to be happy for her...</i>

21:44.890 --> 21:47.030
<i>But... But...</i>

21:47.940 --> 21:52.990
It's an honor, truly, but I must refuse.

21:52.990 --> 21:54.940
Whaaa?

21:54.940 --> 21:57.030
Wh-What?

22:03.180 --> 22:05.530
You're sure about this, Chris?

22:05.530 --> 22:09.760
I already decided to always be by your side.
So it doesn't bother me at all.

22:09.760 --> 22:13.680
You're saying that, but the real 
reason is that the commander

22:13.680 --> 22:17.970
doesn't get a lot of chances to 
fight on the front lines, right?

22:18.940 --> 22:20.020
You could tell, huh?

22:21.190 --> 22:24.360
Chris, let's be friends forever, okay?

22:24.700 --> 22:27.140
Yeah, let's do our best together, Rani!

22:28.380 --> 22:30.120
Now, let's go home.

22:30.120 --> 22:31.250
Yeah.

22:31.250 --> 22:32.970
Wait, you two.

22:33.830 --> 22:36.160
We're not done talking yet.

22:40.310 --> 22:45.390
I wanted to bring you here 
to thank you for your efforts yesterday.

22:45.390 --> 22:49.430
This feast was actually intended to celebrate
Inglis's appointment as commander, but yeah.

22:49.740 --> 22:52.950
You're not going to turn 
this down too, are you?

22:52.950 --> 22:55.360
Not at all, Your Majesty!

22:55.360 --> 22:57.640
We accept with pleasure!

22:57.640 --> 22:58.890
Now, let's both say it together...

22:58.890 --> 23:01.370
Meat!

23:44.940 --> 23:49.940
Comic by Kuromura Moto
